# VCasT All Stats 0001

This example runs VCasT's `stats` mode directly on gridded GRIB2 files: it compares a
1-hr HRRR 2m temperature (T2M) forecast against a HRRR analysis (both GRIB2, no
interpolation) and computes a broad set of statistics in a single run -- RMSE, bias,
quantiles, MAE, correlation, standard deviation, and several threshold-based scores
(GSS, FBIAS, POD, FAR, CSI at a 290K threshold with a 2-gridpoint radius of influence).

## Command

```bash
# Computes all configured stats and writes them to stat.out
vcast stat.yaml
```
